WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Zhou Ting, after half a night's work, you found out two pairs of socks.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,320
Zhou Ting, have you had enough trouble?

3
00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:06,400
Without evidence, just bite people randomly

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,640
After putting on the bag, do I still have to be searched?

5
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:10,930
Do you want to treat us all as thieves?

6
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:14,140
This is what you call hidden food

7
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,900
Woke everyone up in the middle of the night

8
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:18,060
Just because it’s impossible to look at these two pairs of white silk stockings!

9
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,260
He must be hiding somewhere else

10
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:20,300
He eats chicken legs every day, something must be...

11
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:22,220
Sister Rose, the bag is empty.

12
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:24,220
But he said that Zhao Ya always runs out in the middle of the night

13
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,260
It's true too

14
00:00:25,260 --> 00:00:26,577
Zhao Ya

15
00:00:26,577 --> 00:00:33,820
Where have you been these past few nights?

16
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:39,010
Take it off, upset stomach

17
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:40,990
It's best

18
00:00:40,990 --> 00:00:42,830
Let me catch you running around in the middle of the night again

19
00:00:42,830 --> 00:00:44,910
Just get out of the camp

20
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:47,070
That's enough, everyone is already very tired

21
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:48,350
Stop talking nonsense

22
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:50,670
Everyone, go to bed, Sister Rose, I...

23
00:00:50,670 --> 00:00:52,190
Your food is gone tonight

24
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:54,430
You will go alone to fetch water tomorrow

25
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:56,030
Do something embarrassing like this happen again?

26
00:00:56,030 --> 00:01:09,780
Go to sleep

27
00:01:09,780 --> 00:01:17,980
If you let me turn over

28
00:01:17,980 --> 00:01:21,250
If something goes wrong, it's me Guo Quan

29
00:01:21,250 --> 00:01:25,950
You all just wait for me
